{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00094",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.17,
      "end_seconds": 5.4,
      "duration_seconds": 4.23,
      "text": "Well, hello doctor, sorry, am I early?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.04,
      "end_seconds": 10.85,
      "duration_seconds": 4.81,
      "text": "Of course, put it down anywhere. So, how can I help?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 11.53,
      "end_seconds": 16.68,
      "duration_seconds": 5.15,
      "text": "Honestly, it's a fever, and my family pushed me to come."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 17.34,
      "end_seconds": 20.05,
      "duration_seconds": 2.71,
      "text": "How long are we talking about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 21.21,
      "end_seconds": 23.97,
      "duration_seconds": 2.76,
      "text": "I've had it for five days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 27.88,
      "end_seconds": 30.12,
      "duration_seconds": 2.24,
      "text": "How intense does it get?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 31.25,
      "end_seconds": 32.65,
      "duration_seconds": 1.4,
      "text": "I'd say moderate."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 34.67,
      "end_seconds": 36.6,
      "duration_seconds": 1.93,
      "text": "Have you had chills?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 38.09,
      "end_seconds": 41.71,
      "duration_seconds": 3.62,
      "text": "Yes, about the same, two weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 42.49,
      "end_seconds": 46.32,
      "duration_seconds": 3.83,
      "text": "Alright, first the numbers, if you don't mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 57.69,
      "end_seconds": 58.65,
      "duration_seconds": 0.96,
      "text": "Almost there..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 75.49,
      "end_seconds": 87.08,
      "duration_seconds": 11.59,
      "text": "Okay: oxygen saturation is 97 percent, temperature 39.1. And height 167 centimetres, heart rate 106, weight 88 kilos, BP is 109 over 80."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 88.99,
      "end_seconds": 92.41,
      "duration_seconds": 3.42,
      "text": "Right, let me check a few things physically."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 94.34,
      "end_seconds": 96.23,
      "duration_seconds": 1.89,
      "text": "Let me press here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 106.19,
      "end_seconds": 111.48,
      "duration_seconds": 5.29,
      "text": "There's a small scab where the cut was, no pus coming out."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 117.44,
      "end_seconds": 126.28,
      "duration_seconds": 8.84,
      "text": "Okay, you can sit up. Alright, have you noticed vomiting, red streaks going up the leg or pus?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 127.61,
      "end_seconds": 129.66,
      "duration_seconds": 2.05,
      "text": "No, none of those."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 131.4,
      "end_seconds": 133.64,
      "duration_seconds": 2.24,
      "text": "Has your skin been okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 135.06,
      "end_seconds": 137.19,
      "duration_seconds": 2.13,
      "text": "No, skin's been fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 139.21,
      "end_seconds": 144.71,
      "duration_seconds": 5.5,
      "text": "Right, what about your general health, any conditions you're being treated for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 145.31,
      "end_seconds": 151.67,
      "duration_seconds": 6.36,
      "text": "I have diabetes, for about ten years. I've had heart disease, yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 153.37,
      "end_seconds": 155.34,
      "duration_seconds": 1.97,
      "text": "Okay, and what else?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 162.7,
      "end_seconds": 166.78,
      "duration_seconds": 4.08,
      "text": "Let's go through your medication. What are you taking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 167.53,
      "end_seconds": 171.41,
      "duration_seconds": 3.88,
      "text": "I take aspirin, 75 milligrams, once a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 173.05,
      "end_seconds": 175.45,
      "duration_seconds": 2.4,
      "text": "Any drug or food allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 177.48,
      "end_seconds": 178.46,
      "duration_seconds": 0.98,
      "text": "No allergies."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 187.98,
      "end_seconds": 189.35,
      "duration_seconds": 1.37,
      "text": "Do you smoke?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 189.91,
      "end_seconds": 191.46,
      "duration_seconds": 1.55,
      "text": "I've never smoked."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 193.01,
      "end_seconds": 195.39,
      "duration_seconds": 2.38,
      "text": "And what do you usually eat?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 197.04,
      "end_seconds": 200.17,
      "duration_seconds": 3.13,
      "text": "Mostly home-cooked food, rice and vegetables."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 201.68,
      "end_seconds": 204.11,
      "duration_seconds": 2.43,
      "text": "Who's at home with you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 204.93,
      "end_seconds": 209.61,
      "duration_seconds": 4.68,
      "text": "It's just me and my wife at home now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 210.9,
      "end_seconds": 212.36,
      "duration_seconds": 1.46,
      "text": "How about exercise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 214.29,
      "end_seconds": 217.64,
      "duration_seconds": 3.35,
      "text": "Not really, I don't get much exercise."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 228.46,
      "end_seconds": 232.16,
      "duration_seconds": 3.7,
      "text": "Alright, have you had to have anything operated on?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 232.71,
      "end_seconds": 237.54,
      "duration_seconds": 4.83,
      "text": "Yes, I had a bypass operation, six years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 238.34,
      "end_seconds": 249.48,
      "duration_seconds": 11.14,
      "text": "So, based on the history and the examination, it's hard to say. Cellulitis is one possibility and an abscess forming another, and I'd rather not commit yet."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 257.43,
      "end_seconds": 261.83,
      "duration_seconds": 4.4,
      "text": "I want a wound swab done, that's for infected wound."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CLINICAL_STAFF",
      "start_seconds": 264.95,
      "end_seconds": 269.79,
      "duration_seconds": 4.84,
      "text": "We have a slot Thursday at 10 am, if that works."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 271.07,
      "end_seconds": 272.05,
      "duration_seconds": 0.98,
      "text": "That's fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 275.51,
      "end_seconds": 297.28,
      "duration_seconds": 21.77,
      "text": "We'll begin with clindamycin, 300 milligrams, three times a day, for seven days. It's for skin infection. Keep the leg raised on a pillow when you're sitting. Make sure you're drinking plenty of fluids, two to three litres a day if you can, and get proper rest."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 297.84,
      "end_seconds": 304.16,
      "duration_seconds": 6.32,
      "text": "Understood. See me again in two days. Take care, and call us if anything changes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 305.37,
      "end_seconds": 307.19,
      "duration_seconds": 1.82,
      "text": "No questions. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 308.51,
      "end_seconds": 309.78,
      "duration_seconds": 1.27,
      "text": "Bye for now."
    }
  ]
}